- `id`: asset id/slug/code returned from catalog.

Query:
- `package_type`: `DATA-ONLY` or `DATA-VOICE-SMS`. Defaults to `DATA-ONLY`.

Response:
```json
{
  "type": "country",
  "id": "united-states",
  "package_type": "DATA-ONLY",
  "bundles": [
    {
      "id": "bundle_id",
      "name": "1GB - 7 Days",
      "data": "1 GB",
      "validity": "7 Days",
      "price": 4.5,
      "price_formatted": "$4.50"
    }
  ]
}
```

PAYSTACK CARD PAYMENT: eSIM

Flow:
1. User chooses an eSIM asset and bundle.
2. Mobile calls initialize.
3. Mobile opens Paystack checkout using returned `access_code`.
4. After Paystack success callback, mobile calls verify.
5. If fulfillment is pending, poll status every 5-10 seconds until `fulfillment.ok === true` or show support fallback.
6. Save/display returned QR fields and refresh `/api/my-esims`.

1. Initialize eSIM Card Payment
`POST /api/paystack/initialize`

Auth: Bearer token

Body:
```json
{
  "type": "country",
  "id": "united-states",
  "bundle": "bundle_id",
  "package_type": "DATA-ONLY",
  "currency": "NGN",
  "topup_esim_id": null
}
```

Notes:
- `currency` can be `NGN` or `USD`.
- Omit or send empty `topup_esim_id` for a new eSIM.
- For top-up, set `topup_esim_id` to the user's existing `esim.esim_id` from `/api/my-esims`.

Response:
```json
{
  "reference": "uuid-reference",
  "access_code": "paystack_access_code",
  "amount": 100000,
  "currency": "NGN",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "conversion": {
    "usd_price": 5,
    "usd_to_ngn_rate": 1500,
    "rate_source": "api_or_fallback",
    "ngn_amount_raw": 7500,
    "ngn_amount_adjusted": 7500,
    "ngn_amount_minor": 750000,
    "currency": "NGN"
  }
}
```

2. Verify eSIM Card Payment And Fulfill
`POST /api/paystack/verify`

Auth: Bearer token

Body:
```json
{ "reference": "uuid-reference" }
```

Success response:
```json
{
  "ok": true,
  "status": "success",
  "reference": "uuid-reference",
  "data": {},
  "fulfillment": {
    "ok": true,
    "synced": true,
    "type": "country",
    "id": "united-states",
    "bundle": "bundle_id",
    "package_type": "DATA-ONLY",
    "topup_esim_id": null,
    "esim_id": "provider-esim-id",
    "order_id": "provider-order-id",
    "iccid": "iccid",
    "activation_code": "activation-code",
    "lpa": "lpa-string",
    "puk_code": "",
    "number": "",
    "esim_status": "active",
    "direct_installation_link_ios": "",
    "direct_installation_link_android": "",
    "qr_code_url": "",
    "qr_payload": "LPA:...",
    "qr_code_data_url": "data:image/svg+xml;base64,...",
    "smdp_address": "smdp.example.com"
  }
}
```

Pending response:
```json
{
  "ok": true,
  "status": "success",
  "reference": "uuid-reference",
  "fulfillment": {
    "ok": false,
    "pending": true,
    "synced": false,
    "message": "Payment confirmed. Preparing your eSIM..."
  }
}
```

3. Poll eSIM Card Payment Status
`POST /api/paystack/status`

Auth: Bearer token

Body:
```json
{ "reference": "uuid-reference" }
```

Response:
- Same shape as verify.
- Only call after verify returns a pending fulfillment payload.

